{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他开始害怕对方有一天不再需要自己，甚至觉得和自己待在一起也不自在；他因此收住了期待，但想起两人仍然亲近，又有一点高兴。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、害怕被嫌弃、克制、犹豫、一点高兴\",\n      \"missed\": \"中间段落里想靠近的劲其实还没有松开，以及声音悬在半空、明朗逐渐被薄雾柔化的音乐画面，需要逐句读才能抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他突然安静下来，不敢再继续想象两人的未来，因为开始担心对方不再需要自己；但现实中两人仍然亲近，这让他稍稍安心。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、患得患失、克制、短暂安心\",\n      \"missed\": \"下方动画此时较密集，可能分走一点注意力。音乐从轻柔悬停到逐渐下沉变暗的变化，以及他想靠近却仍然绷着的状态，不容易一眼读全。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他不敢再往远处期待，开始担心自己对对方不再重要，但又从对方始终没有退开、两人仍然亲近这件事里找到一点安慰。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、迟疑、害怕失去、些许高兴\",\n      \"missed\": \"对方也许同样喜欢他在身边，这只是他的猜测而非确定事实；另外，音乐变暗但光还在的画面隐喻，需要读正文才能理解。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 4,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三条大字都很醒目，但每条都承载了较长的多层意思，彼此也都在争夺注意力。第一眼能抓住核心担忧，也能大体看懂从害怕、安静到重新获得一点安慰的过程；但音乐画面与人物心理之间的对应关系主要藏在字号较小的正文里，无法在一次快速扫读中完整建立。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a97ca67e-703d-4c78-ae89-4d54e41a6d05", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T224524845508Z", "elapsed_seconds": 81.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:46:46.529218+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8e07800c6ee8ad412e33ceb187b69e3fba947472e46c35e2accedd2bd41ac904", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T224524845508Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "09a1e7fd93f268b6df18d05a1ce194361e95dcfb6e2f590f3fbaceb42c55f414"}}}
